      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\n\n<div style=\"padding: 1rem; background: #1e293b; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 2rem;\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #f59e0b;\">🌐 Quick Language Switcher (14 Official Languages)</div>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem;\">\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs.html\" style=\"color: #67e8f9; text-decoration: none;\">🏛️ Editorial Hub</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-en.html\" style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;\">🇬🇧 EN</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-fr.html\" style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;\">🇫🇷 FR</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-it.html\" style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;\">🇮🇹 IT</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-ru.html\" style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;\">🇷🇺 RU</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-el.html\" style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;\">🇬🇷 EL</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-tt.html\" style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;\">🌐 TT</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-ba.html\" style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;\">🌐 BA</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-br.html\" style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;\">🌐 BR</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-pt.html\" style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;\">🇵🇹 PT</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-es.html\" style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;\">🇪🇸 ES</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-de.html\" style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;\">🇩🇪 DE</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-hy.html\" style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;\">🇦🇲 HY</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-ka.html\" style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;\">🇬🇪 KA</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-cv.html\" style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;\">🌐 CV</a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"august-issue-banner\">\n    <div class=\"august-banner-badge\">🇪🇸 Spanish Edition</div>\n    <div class=\"august-banner-content\">\n        <h4>Top 10 Essential Verbs in Spanish (CEFR A0–A1 Level)</h4>\n        <p>A beginner-friendly breakdown of the 10 highest-yield verbs in Spanish. Master conjugations, collocations, false friends, and daily expressions tailored for absolute beginners!</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2rem 0;\">\n    <h3 class=\"editorial-heading\">📚 1. Conjugation Highlights & Essential Patterns</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;\">For A0–A1 learners in Spanish, focusing on the present tense, simple past, and immediate future forms allows you to express over 80% of daily communication needs. Here are the core patterns for the top verbs:</p>\n    <ul style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        <li><strong>To Be:</strong> Used for identity, location, and states. Watch out for possessive or dative traps!</li>\n        <li><strong>To Have:</strong> Essential for possession, age, and physical feelings in many languages.</li>\n        <li><strong>To Do / Make:</strong> The workhorse verb for everyday tasks and creating things.</li>\n        <li><strong>To Go & Come:</strong> Essential directional verbs for travel, invitations, and daily movement.</li>\n        <li><strong>To Say / Tell:</strong> How to report thoughts, ask questions, and interact socially.</li>\n        <li><strong>To See & Know:</strong> Differentiating visual perception from factual knowledge and familiarity.</li>\n        <li><strong>To Want & Like:</strong> Expressing desires, ordering items, and sharing preferences.</li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2rem 0;\">\n    <h3 class=\"editorial-heading\">🗣️ 2. High-Frequency Collocations & Natural Phrasing</h3>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">\n        <div style=\"padding: 1rem; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong style=\"color: #0d9488;\">Identity & Location</strong>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;\">Saying your name, nationality, profession, and where you are located.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 1rem; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong style=\"color: #0d9488;\">Daily Routines</strong>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;\">Having meals, going to work/school, coming home, making coffee.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 1rem; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px;\">\n            <strong style=\"color: #0d9488;\">Social Interaction</strong>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;\">Saying hello, asking for help, expressing likes, wanting items politely.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2rem 0;\">\n    <h3 class=\"editorial-heading\">💬 3. Cultural & Idiomatic Expressions (A0–A1 Adapted)</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;\">In Spanish, simple verbs combine with everyday nouns to form natural expressions that native speakers use constantly. Master these key expressions to sound natural from day one!</p>\n</section>\n\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.5rem 0;\">\n    <h3 class=\"editorial-heading\">🔍 Comparative Linguistics Matrix (14 Languages)</h3>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--ink-secondary); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">See how the core concept translates directly across all 14 official COSY languages:</p>\n\n    <div style=\"overflow-x: auto;\">\n        <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.85rem; text-align: left;\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #0d9488; color: #ffffff;\">\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">Verb Concept</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇬🇧 EN</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇫🇷 FR</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇮🇹 IT</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇪🇸 ES</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇵🇹 PT</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇩🇪 DE</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇷🇺 RU</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇬🇷 EL</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🌐 BR</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇦🇲 HY</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🌐 TT</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🌐 BA</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🌐 CV</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇬🇪 KA</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;\">1. Be</td>\n                    <td>be</td><td>être</td><td>essere</td><td>ser/estar</td><td>ser/estar</td><td>sein</td><td>быть</td><td>είμαι</td><td>bezañ</td><td>լինել</td><td>булу</td><td>булыу</td><td>пулма</td><td>ყოფნა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #f8fafc;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;\">2. Have</td>\n                    <td>have</td><td>avoir</td><td>avere</td><td>tener</td><td>ter</td><td>haben</td><td>у меня есть</td><td>έχω</td><td>kaout</td><td>ունենալ</td><td>бар/ия булу</td><td>бар/эйә булыу</td><td>пур/пулма</td><td>ქონა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;\">3. Do/Make</td>\n                    <td>do/make</td><td>faire</td><td>fare</td><td>hacer</td><td>fazer</td><td>machen</td><td>делать</td><td>κάνω</td><td>ober</td><td>անել</td><td>эшләү</td><td>эшләү</td><td>тăвас</td><td>კეთება</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #f8fafc;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;\">4. Go</td>\n                    <td>go</td><td>aller</td><td>andare</td><td>ir</td><td>ir</td><td>gehen</td><td>идти</td><td>πηγαίνω</td><td>mont</td><td>գնալ</td><td>бару</td><td>барыу</td><td>кайрма</td><td>წასვლა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;\">5. Come</td>\n                    <td>come</td><td>venir</td><td>venire</td><td>venir</td><td>vir</td><td>kommen</td><td>приходить</td><td>έρχομαι</td><td>dont</td><td>գալ</td><td>килү</td><td>килеү</td><td>килме</td><td>მოსვლა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #f8fafc;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;\">6. Say/Tell</td>\n                    <td>say/tell</td><td>dire</td><td>dire</td><td>decir</td><td>dizer</td><td>sagen</td><td>говорить</td><td>λέω</td><td>lavar</td><td>ասել</td><td>әйтү</td><td>әйтеү</td><td>калама</td><td>თქმა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;\">7. See/Look</td>\n                    <td>see</td><td>voir</td><td>vedere</td><td>ver</td><td>ver</td><td>sehen</td><td>видеть</td><td>βλέπω</td><td>gwelout</td><td>տեսնել</td><td>креү</td><td>күреү</td><td>курма</td><td>ნახვა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #f8fafc;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;\">8. Know</td>\n                    <td>know</td><td>savoir</td><td>sapere</td><td>saber</td><td>saber</td><td>wissen</td><td>знать</td><td>ξέρω</td><td>gouzout</td><td>իմանալ</td><td>белү</td><td>белеү</td><td>пĕлме</td><td>ცოდნა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;\">9. Want</td>\n                    <td>want</td><td>vouloir</td><td>volere</td><td>querer</td><td>querer</td><td>wollen</td><td>хотеть</td><td>θέλω</td><td>c'hoant kaout</td><td>ուզել</td><td>теләү</td><td>теләү</td><td>былмаш</td><td>ნდომა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #f8fafc;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;\">10. Like/Give</td>\n                    <td>like</td><td>aimer</td><td>piacere</td><td>gustar</td><td>gostar</td><td>mögen</td><td>нравиться</td><td>μου αρέσει</td><td>plijout</td><td>հավանել</td><td>ошату</td><td>ошатыу</td><td>килĕшме</td><td>მოწონება</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2rem 0; padding: 1.5rem; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #0d9488;\">\n    <h4 style=\"margin-top:0;\">💡 Family Nuances & Grammatical Highlights</h4>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\"><strong>Indo-European (Romance, Germanic, Slavic, Hellenic, Celtic, Armenian):</strong> Tense systems and auxiliary verbs structure time and aspect.</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\"><strong>Turkic (Tatar, Bashkir, Chuvash):</strong> Agglutinative suffixes denote person, tense, and mood without separate auxiliary words.</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0;\"><strong>Kartvelian (Georgian):</strong> Ergative alignment and polypersonal verbal markers express subject and object together.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2rem 0;\">\n    <h3 class=\"editorial-heading\">🎯 Practice & Ecosystem Links</h3>\n    <div style=\"display:flex; gap:1rem; flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n        <a href=\"https://cosylanguages.github.io/COSYpractice/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"padding:0.75rem 1.25rem; background:#d97706; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold; border-radius:6px;\">Practice Drills in COSYpractice ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"https://cosylanguages.github.io/COSYtools/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"padding:0.75rem 1.25rem; background:#0d9488; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold; border-radius:6px;\">Verb Tables in COSYtools ↗</a>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n"
    }
  ],
